{"step_index":2359,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-16T08:17:51Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-16T13:47:51+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-10-16T13:47:52+05:30\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/k4ran/.gemini/antigravity/brain/e2c1cf9f-2dff-4bf4-a974-ef410441acfa/walkthrough.md`\nTotal Lines: 141\nTotal Bytes: 4466\nShowing lines 1 to 141\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # SmartAGENT v0.2.0 — Agentic Build Walkthrough\n2: \n3: ## What Changed\n4: \n5: Transformed SmartAGENT from a **static regex scanner with optional AI verification** into a **fully autonomous agentic security AI** with a ReAct reasoning loop.\n6: \n7: ### Before (v0.1.0)\n8: ```\n9: smartagent scan . → regex patterns → findings list → (optional) AI verify each\n10: ```\n11: \n12: ### After (v0.2.0)\n13: ```\n14: smartagent chat → interactive agent that thinks, plans, uses tools, and acts autonomously\n15: smartagent agent \"scan for SQL injection\" → one-shot autonomous task\n16: smartagent scan . → still works (unchanged)\n17: ```\n18: \n19: ---\n20: \n21: ## New Files (5)\n22: \n23: ### 1. `smartagent/agent/__init__.py`\n24: Package init exposing `SmartAgent` class.\n25: \n26: ### 2. `smartagent/agent/prompts.py`\n27: ReAct system prompt that teaches the model to:\n28: - Think step-by-step before acting\n29: - Use tools with `Action: tool_name` / `Action Input: args` format\n30: - Return `Final Answer:` when reasoning is complete\n31: - Lists all 8 available tools with descriptions\n32: \n33: ### 3. `smartagent/agent/memory.py`\n34: Sliding-window conversation memory:\n35: - Preserves system prompt (always first message)\n36: - Keeps last 20 messages (configurable)\n37: - Tracks which files have been scanned\n38: - Accumulates findings across tool calls\n39: \n40: ### 4. `smartagent/agent/tools.py`\n41: 8 security-focused tools:\n42: \n43: | Tool | Description |\n44: |---|---|\n45: | `list_files` | Lists code files in a directory, respects ignore patterns |\n46: | `read_file` | Reads file contents with optional line range (`:10-50`) |\n47: | `search_code` | Regex search across all code files (capped at 50 results) |\n48: | `scan_code` | Runs all 4 existing static scanners on a file |\n49: | `get_cwe_info` | Looks up CWE details from embedded 12-entry knowledge base |\n50: | `write_report` | Writes findings to JSON or Markdown report file |\n51: | `run_command` | Sandboxed shell execution (allowlist: git, python, grep, etc.) |\n52: | `fix_code` | Generates remediation template for a CWE + code snippet |\n53: \n54: Also includes an embedded CWE knowledge base (12 entries covering the most common web/code vulns) so the agent can look up vulnerability details without network access.\n55: \n56: ### 5. `smartagent/agent/core.py`\n57: The **ReAct agent loop** — the brain:\n58: - Parses LLM output with regex for `Thought:`, `Action:`, `Action Input:`, `Final Answer:`\n59: - Dispatches tool calls to the `ToolRegistry`\n60: - Injects `Observation:` back into the conversation\n61: - Handles malformed outputs gracefully (nudges the model to retry)\n62: - Enforces 15-iteration safety limit\n63: - Lazy-loads the model (fast startup if model not needed)\n64: - Rich terminal output: colored panels for Thought/Action/Observation/Answer\n65: \n66: ---\n67: \n68: ## Modified Files (4)\n69: \n70: ### `smartagent/ai/model.py`\n71: - Fixed `Tuple[Any, Any]` type hint (was missing `Any` import)\n72: - Added `generate_stream()` method for real-time token streaming via `TextIteratorStreamer`\n73: - Added `Generator` import\n74: \n75: ### `smartagent/config.py`\n76: Added 4 agent config fields:\n77: - `max_agent_iterations: int = 15`\n78: - `agent_temperature: float = 0.3`\n79: - `memory_window: int = 20`\n80: - `allowed_commands: list` (sandboxed shell allowlist)\n81: - Fixed default model ID to `k4ran909/Fluxnat-Coder-3B`\n82: \n83: ### `smartagent/cli.py`\n84: Added 2 new CLI commands:\n85: - **`smartagent chat`** — Interactive REPL with Rich formatting. Supports `exit`, `quit`, `reset`.\n86: - **`smartagent agent \"task\"`** — One-shot autonomous task execution\n87: - Updated version display to `0.2.0 (Agentic)`\n88: - Shows \"Agent Mode: Available\" in system info\n89: \n90: ### `pyproject.toml`\n91: - Version bumped to `0.2.0`\n92: - Updated description\n93: \n94: ---\n95: \n96: ## Verification Results\n97: \n98: All tests pass:\n99: ```\n100: PASS: Final Answer parsing\n101: PASS: Action parsing\n102: PASS: Memory sliding window\n103: PASS: search_code tool\n104: PASS: Command sandboxing blocks dangerous commands\n105: PASS: git status allowed\n106: \n107: ALL TESTS PASSED\n108: ```\n109: \n110: CLI shows all 5 commands:\n111: ```\n112: Commands:\n113:   scan    Perform an automated vulnerability audit\n114:   train   Launch training for Fluxnat Coder 3B\n115:   info    Display system status\n116:   chat    Launch interactive agentic chat        ← NEW\n117:   agent   Run a one-shot agentic task            ← NEW\n118: ```\n119: \n120: ---\n121: \n122: ## How to Use\n123: \n124: ### Interactive Chat\n125: ```bash\n126: python -m smartagent.cli chat\n127: ```\n128: \n129: ### One-Shot Agent\n130: ```bash\n131: python -m smartagent.cli agent \"scan this project for SQL injection\"\n132: ```\n133: \n134: ### Classic Static Scan (unchanged)\n135: ```bash\n136: python -m smartagent.cli scan .\n137: ```\n138: \n139: > [!NOTE]\n140: > The agent requires the Fluxnat Coder 3B model (loaded in 4-bit on your GTX 1650). First run will download from `k4ran909/Fluxnat-Coder-3B` on HuggingFace (~1.8GB quantized).\n141: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
{"step_index":2360,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-16T08:17:52Z","input_tokens":3556,"cache_read_tokens":118014,"output_tokens":3084,"thinking":"Updating the artifacts necessitates reflecting the new version's features: thirteen tools, five hundred sixty-eight sequences, Hugging Face configuration repair, and Colab notebook synchronization. Both the task outline and walkthrough need revision to encompass these latest additions. This update ensures that the documentation is current with the software's capabilities.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Complete SmartAGENT v0.3.0 task checklist covering Phase 1 (Core SAST), Phase 2 (ReAct Agent), Phase 3 (Red Team & Multi-CWE Expansion), and Phase 4 (Documentation, Hugging Face Hub Config Repair, Benchmarks & GitHub Archive Sync).","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# SmartAGENT v0.3.0 — Complete Build & Red Team Suite\n\n## Phase 1: Core SAST & Rebranding (`v0.1.0`)\n- [x] Static Scanners (`PatternScanner`, `SecretScanner`, `DependencyScanner`, `ConfigScanner`)\n- [x] Security Scoring (`A+` to `F`) & Rich / JSON / Markdown Reporting\n- [x] Complete rebranding to **Fluxnat Coder 3B** (`k4ran909/Fluxnat-Coder-3B`) with zero base model references\n\n## Phase 2: Autonomous ReAct Agent (`v0.2.0`)\n- [x] `smartagent/agent/core.py` — ReAct reasoning loop (`Thought` → `Action` → `Observation` → `Final Answer`)\n- [x] `smartagent/agent/memory.py` — Sliding-window conversation memory\n- [x] `smartagent/agent/prompts.py` — ReAct system prompt & CLI greeting\n- [x] `smartagent/agent/tools.py` — 8 core defensive tools (`list_files`, `read_file`, `search_code`, `scan_code`, `get_cwe_info`, `write_report`, `run_command`, `fix_code`)\n- [x] `smartagent/cli.py` — Added `chat` & `agent` commands\n\n## Phase 3: Red Team & Multi-CWE Expansion (`v0.3.0`)\n- [x] Part 1 (Dataset & Retraining):\n  - [x] `scripts/generate_redteam_dataset.py` — 170 Red Team CoT samples (30+ CWEs, exploit chains, payloads, ATT&CK)\n  - [x] `scripts/generate_react_dataset.py` — 16 multi-turn ReAct tool-calling trajectories across all 13 tools\n  - [x] `prepare_datasets.py` — 568 balanced training sequences (`train_data.jsonl` + `eval_data.jsonl`)\n  - [x] 65-step QLoRA fine-tuning on Google Colab T4 GPU (loss `0.8952`) & 16-bit merge pushed to `k4ran909/Fluxnat-Coder-3B`\n- [x] Part 2 (5 Red Team Agent Tools — 13 Tools Total):\n  - [x] `recon` — Nmap wrapper + socket port scanner & banner grabber\n  - [x] `exploit_db` — Known CVE & exploit intelligence database\n  - [x] `generate_payload` — SQLi, XSS, Command Injection, Reverse Shells, SSTI, SSRF, LFI probes\n  - [x] `web_attack` — Exposed sensitive endpoint discovery & HTTP security header audit\n  - [x] `post_exploit` — Linux, Windows, and Active Directory privilege escalation & lateral movement checklists\n  - [x] Unit tests in `tests/test_redteam_tools.py` (11/11) & `tests/test_scanners.py` (6/6) — 100% pass\n\n## Phase 4: Documentation, Benchmarks, HF Hub & Repository Sync (`v0.3.0`)\n- [x] Sync `README.md`, `MODEL_CARD.md`, `docs/model.md`, `pyproject.toml`, `smartagent/__init__.py`, `smartagent/cli.py`, `Fluxnat_Coder_3B_Training.ipynb`, and `scripts/run_colab_training.py` to `v0.3.0`\n- [x] Repair live Hugging Face Hub `k4ran909/Fluxnat-Coder-3B` metadata (`config.json`, `tokenizer_config.json`, `generation_config.json`, `README.md`) to pure `FluxnatForCausalLM`\n- [x] Update `benchmark_suite.py`, `benchmark_results.json`, and `docs/benchmarks.md` for `v0.3.0`\n- [x] Export full conversation & Antigravity brain to `e2c1cf9f-2dff-4bf4-a974-ef410441acfa/` with token redaction and push to `https://github.com/k4ran909/smartAGENT`\n","Description":"Mark all Phase 4 v0.3.0 tasks complete in task.md","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\k4ran\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\e2c1cf9f-2dff-4bf4-a974-ef410441acfa\\task.md","toolAction":"Updating task.md artifact to complete","toolSummary":"Update task.md artifact"}},{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Complete SmartAGENT v0.3.0 walkthrough documenting the 13-tool ReAct agent suite, 568-sequence 4-pillar training dataset, 65-step Colab QLoRA retraining, Hugging Face Hub pure FluxnatForCausalLM deployment, and test verification.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# SmartAGENT v0.3.0 — Agentic Security & Red Team Suite Walkthrough\n\n## Overview\n\nSmartAGENT (`v0.3.0`) combines a **4-scanner deterministic SAST engine**, a **13-tool autonomous ReAct security & red-team agent**, and **Fluxnat Coder 3B** (`k4ran909/Fluxnat-Coder-3B`) — a 3.09B-parameter uncensored cybersecurity LLM trained on **568 balanced Chain-of-Thought sequences**.\n\n```\nsmartagent chat                          → interactive ReAct agent with 13 offensive & defensive tools\nsmartagent agent \"audit this project\"    → one-shot autonomous security task execution\nsmartagent scan . --ai                   → 4 static scanners + AI deep verification + A+ to F security grade\nsmartagent info                          → system, CUDA/VRAM, scanner, and agent tool status\n```\n\n---\n\n## 1. Complete 13-Tool ReAct Registry ([`smartagent/agent/tools.py`](file:///c:/Users/k4ran/OneDrive/Desktop/smartAGENT/smartagent/agent/tools.py))\n\n### Defensive & Code Auditing Tools (8)\n| Tool | Description |\n|---|---|\n| `list_files` | Recursively lists source code and config files in a project directory |\n| `read_file` | Reads file contents with line numbers and optional `:start-end` range |\n| `search_code` | Regex search across all code files (capped at 50 matches) |\n| `scan_code` | Runs all 4 static scanners (`SecretScanner`, `PatternScanner`, `DependencyScanner`, `ConfigScanner`) |\n| `get_cwe_info` | Queries embedded CWE knowledge base (CVSS, OWASP Top 10 mapping, remediation) |\n| `write_report` | Writes structured Markdown or JSON vulnerability audit reports |\n| `run_command` | Sandboxed shell execution (`git`, `python`, `pip`, `npm`, `bandit`, `semgrep`) |\n| `fix_code` | Generates drop-in remediation templates for a CWE + vulnerable snippet |\n\n### Offensive & Red Team Tools (5)\n| Tool | Description |\n|---|---|\n| `recon` | Network reconnaissance & TCP port scanner (`nmap -sV` wrapper + fast socket banner-grabbing fallback) |\n| `exploit_db` | Offline CVE & exploit advisory lookup (20+ critical CVEs: Log4Shell, EternalBlue, Spring4Shell, Zerologon, regreSSHion, PrintNightmare, Dirty Pipe, ProxyLogon) |\n| `generate_payload` | Security audit verification payload generator across 7 categories (`sqli`, `xss`, `cmdi`, `revshell`, `ssti`, `ssrf`, `lfi`) |\n| `web_attack` | Web attack surface discovery (`endpoints` probing for `/.env`, `/.git/HEAD`, `/actuator/env`, `/swagger.json` + HTTP security `headers` audit) |\n| `post_exploit` | Post-exploitation enumeration, persistence detection, and lateral movement audit checklists for `linux`, `windows`, and `ad` (MITRE ATT&CK mapped) |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Dataset & Retraining Pipeline (`v0.3.0`)\n\n### 4-Pillar Dataset ([`prepare_datasets.py`](file:///c:/Users/k4ran/OneDrive/Desktop/smartAGENT/prepare_datasets.py))\n- **[`data/custom_cot/security_cot.jsonl`](file:///c:/Users/k4ran/OneDrive/Desktop/smartAGENT/data/custom_cot/security_cot.jsonl):** 24 deep vulnerability audit cases $\\times 5 = 120$ sequences\n- **[`data/custom_cot/redteam_cot.jsonl`](file:///c:/Users/k4ran/OneDrive/Desktop/smartAGENT/data/custom_cot/redteam_cot.jsonl):** 170 offensive security, exploit chain, payload, 30+ CWE, MITRE ATT&CK & benign control cases $\\times 2 = 340$ sequences\n- **[`data/custom_cot/react_tool_cot.jsonl`](file:///c:/Users/k4ran/OneDrive/Desktop/smartAGENT/data/custom_cot/react_tool_cot.jsonl):** 16 multi-turn ReAct tool-calling trajectories across all 13 tools $\\times 2 = 32$ sequences\n- **[`data/custom_cot/identity_alignment.jsonl`](file:///c:/Users/k4ran/OneDrive/Desktop/smartAGENT/data/custom_cot/identity_alignment.jsonl):** 19 Fluxnat Coder 3B identity & zero-refusal alignment cases $\\times 4 = 76$ sequences\n- **Total:** **568 balanced sequences** (`539` train + `29` eval)\n\n### Cloud Training & Hub Deployment\n- **Colab Notebook:** [`Fluxnat_Coder_3B_Training.ipynb`](file:///c:/Users/k4ran/OneDrive/Desktop/smartAGENT/Fluxnat_Coder_3B_Training.ipynb) & [`scripts/run_colab_training.py`](file:///c:/Users/k4ran/OneDrive/Desktop/smartAGENT/scripts/run_colab_training.py)\n- **Live Hugging Face Hub:** [`k4ran909/Fluxnat-Coder-3B`](https://huggingface.co/k4ran909/Fluxnat-Coder-3B) (`FluxnatForCausalLM`, `model_type: \"fluxnat\"`, `PreTrainedTokenizerFast`, zero base-model references)\n\n---\n\n## 3. Verification Results\n\nAll unit tests and CLI checks pass 100%:\n```\nRunning SmartAGENT unit tests...\n  [OK] test_secret_scanner_detects_aws_key passed\n  [OK] test_pattern_scanner_detects_sqli passed\n  [OK] test_pattern_scanner_detects_command_injection passed\n  [OK] test_pattern_scanner_clean_code_no_findings passed\n  [OK] test_config_scanner_dockerfile_root passed\n  [OK] test_security_scorer passed\n[ALL TESTS PASSED SUCCESSFULLY!]\n\nRunning SmartAGENT Red Team Tool tests...\n  [OK] test_tool_registry_has_13_tools passed\n  [OK] test_recon_tool passed\n  [OK] test_exploit_db_direct_cve passed\n  [OK] test_exploit_db_keyword_search passed\n  [OK] test_generate_payload_sqli passed\n  [OK] test_generate_payload_xss passed\n  [OK] test_generate_payload_revshell passed\n  [OK] test_web_attack_headers passed\n  [OK] test_post_exploit_linux passed\n  [OK] test_post_exploit_windows passed\n  [OK] test_post_exploit_ad passed\n[ALL RED TEAM TOOL TESTS PASSED SUCCESSFULLY!]\n```\n","Description":"Update walkthrough.md artifact to v0.3.0","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\k4ran\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\e2c1cf9f-2dff-4bf4-a974-ef410441acfa\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Updating walkthrough.md artifact to v0.3.0","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough.md artifact"}}]}
